@startuml
title UML sequence — Place youth in cohorts and invite them (L2-130)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
actor "Tom (Admin)" as p
box "Frontend — Angular app" #E0F2FE
participant ImportRosterPage as page
end box
box "Backend — PromiseHub.Api" #D1FADF
participant "ImportEndpoints + RequireModule(Roster)" as api
end box
box "Backend — PromiseHub.Application" #ECFDF3
participant SaveMappingHandler as map
participant RunImportHandler as run
participant InvitationIssuer as inv
end box
p -> page : maps Group to Cohort, Youth email to Youth email
page -> api : PUT /imports/{id}/mapping
api -> map : HandleAsync
map -> map : YouthEmail needs Learning and ManageStaff or 422 (c5)
map -> map : cohorts matched by name in this organization (c2, c6)
map -> map : who can be invited, and why not (c2)
api --> page : placements, invitations, rows that need a look
p -> page : Import
page -> api : POST /imports/{id}/run
api -> run : HandleAsync
run -> run : households and children; enrol in the matched cohort once (c3, c4)
run -> run : save; audit the import with places and invitations (c3)
loop each invitable row
run -> inv : IssueAsync(email, Youth, child)
inv -> inv : audit Created on StaffInvitation; email the link (c3)
end
api --> page : enrolled, invited, notPlaced, notInvited
page -> p : Placed in cohorts, Youth invited
@enduml
